-- From the game's Colosseum code (ColosseumController / ColosseumClientAdapter / ColosseumRunUI):
--   * entrance: workspace["WaveDefence Island"].WaveDefense.Colosseum; walking in fires
--     "StartColosseum", which asks "Pet Defense: Play / Not now"
--   * 30 minute cooldown: Data.Colosseum.Cooldown + 1800
