do -- own scope (keeps the top level under Luau's 200-local limit)
-- From the game's ShrineConfig / ShrineController:
--   * shrine at workspace.Ts2Islands.Autumn.Shrine, usable within 45 studs
--   * ShrineService.Choose(key) with key "Luck", "Golden" or "AutoClicker"
--   * the blessing tiers up the longer you keep it: I x1.1, II x1.25 (10 min), III x1.5 (25 min)
--   * switching resets the tier, and the blessing resets when you leave the game
