    description = "Off (default): totems and dials are only used while Auto Hatch / Auto Index is hatching and you're at the egg. On: Auto Place Totems & Dials works any time it is switched on: the picked weather dials are used whenever you own one and its weather isn't already running, and the picked totems are placed on the ground where you stand (up to 3 of each kind, 5 in total). Still needs Auto Place Totems & Dials switched on.",
