-- Shared.Game.HalloweenDungeon.* + Controllers.Game.HalloweenDungeonController (its GetContext() gives the game's own
-- service object: State() = the run, InRun(), RunFolder(), Service = the HalloweenDungeonService signals).
--   * Unlock: talk to Count Greg (CountGregMansion.CountGreg, ~(-1490, -499, -2040)): Service.Talk:Fire() next to him
--     sets Data.HalloweenDungeon.Unlocked (and the first contract step).
--   * A run: stand in the EntryCircle's Zone (~(-1433, -492, -2014)) for the 10 s countdown (up to 4 players share a
--     run, +10% loot each). One run every 30 min (Config.ReadyAt(Data) = LastStart + 1800). 6-8 rooms, each with an
--     objective (Foyer chests, bat ambush, mimic hunt, bat pinata, treasure vault, candle ritual, Elder Bat), then
--     Count Greg. A cleared room's door opens and the run moves on by itself after ~25 s (or when you walk through).
--   * Fighting = normal taps (TapService.TapRequested) at the server-side target: Service.SetTarget(mobId) for bats,
--     mimics, thieves, the pinata (1 damage a tap); Service.ChestTarget(chestId) for chests (10 a tap; models with a
--     "ChestId" attribute in the run folder, "Opened" when done); Count Greg takes taps with no target (2 a tap). In his
--     Swarm phase BossState.MedallionId is the bat to hit (3 hits). His Sweep (BossAttack {Kind = "Sweep", HitAt})
--     is dodged by jumping. Mobs come from MobState {Id, Hp, Kind} / MobRemoved {Id}.
--   * Blessing offers (BlessingOffer {OfferId, Choices}) are answered with BlessingPick(OfferId, choice).
--   * Vampire Relics: "Interactable" models with InteractableId "VampireRelic" and a RelicId; CollectRelic(RelicId).
--   * Candle ritual: Candle {Kind = "Setup", Folder, Candles = {Id, Name}} then {Kind = "Hint", Order, StartAt, Step}:
--     step on the candles (their "Wick") in that order.
--   * Contracts (ContractConfig, paid automatically): Apprentice (talk, 30 bats, 60 chests), Regular (2 clears,
--     10 mimics, a pinata), Bane (Count Greg x5, a clear without a knockout, 300 bats) = +1 egg every hatch until
--     Halloween ends + the Count Batula pet. First test run: full clear in 7 min, flawless, contract 1 done.
tab:CreateSection({ name = "Count Greg's Mansion" })
H.D = {
    on = false, run = 0,
    GREG = Vector3.new(-1490, -498.7, -2040),
    CIRCLE = Vector3.new(-1433.3, -494, -2014.5),
    -- blessing picks, best first (candy and coins, then damage, then staying alive)
    BLESSINGS = { "CandySack", "LuckyLoot", "ChestCracker", "GregSlayer", "BatBane", "PetFury", "IronCape", "VampireBite", "BusyPaws", "ThickFur" },
}
