;(function() -- its own function: a do-block's locals count against the main chunk's 200 limit
-- Plays the game forward on its own, for a brand new account or an old one:
--   1) the game's tutorial (OnboardingConfig.DeriveStep = the step it's on): starter pet, first
--      eggs, teams, rebirths, Critical Clicks, Spotted / Spiked eggs, Greg's bridge, Auto Clicker,
--      Sky Island
--   2) then the quest list (QuestConfig): open eggs, turn pets golden, unlock islands; finished
--      quests are claimed
--   3) and always: tap, equip your best pets, unlock the next island when you can, rebirth when
--      there's nothing closer to save for
-- Every round it looks at your data again and does one thing, so it picks up wherever you are.
local OnboardingConfig, QuestCfg, IslandCfg, RebirthCfg, RebirthButtons, SkillFormula, PetPowerMod, BridgeZone
